 <h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="overview">Overview</h2>
 <p>When building real-world web apps with Jinja2, it’s easy to end up with repeated HTML fragments. Just like organizing code for reuse, it would be ideal to reuse smaller sections of HTML template code. That’s what this library is all about.</p>
 </section>
